WEBVTT

00:00:00.108 --> 00:00:07.812
This video shows how to record an expense on your phone. Use it for money the school spends, such as a bill.

00:00:09.487 --> 00:00:20.455
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Finance, and choose Expenses. The page lists expenses and has filters for dates, category and account.

00:00:23.015 --> 00:00:29.183
Tap Add Expense at the top of the page. A form opens for the new expense.

00:00:30.138 --> 00:00:44.802
Enter the amount, here 12000. Choose the category, Utilities, and the account that pays, Main Cash. Then type a description, here Electricity bill. The date is today by default.

00:00:45.621 --> 00:00:54.573
Tap Add Expense to save. A message says the expense was recorded, the window closes, and the new expense appears in the list.

00:00:59.719 --> 00:01:08.935
To review expenses by type, use the Category filter. A Category Breakdown also shows how much was spent in each category.

00:01:16.572 --> 00:01:23.220
The expense is recorded. You can come back here any time to review what the school has spent.
